:: S: AskavaPermit 1 [storylet] {"position":"4500,1900","size":"100,100"}
{=

(storylet: when
$place's sublocation is "The Provincial Court of Askava"
and ($time's day > 1 and it < 7)
and $char's player's inv does not contain "permitAskava"
)
(metadata: "title", "Apply for an Entry Permit", "cardDesc", "The Hall of Immigration Affairs building is packed full of those seeking permission to enter mainland Askava.", "img", "https://thefifthcity.wiki/w/images/3/3f/Currency3_copper.png",)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage:)'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[
The imperial guardsmen here are dressed in silk and metal, spears in their hands. They eye you apathetically. You wonder if they know you are a magus. To be fair, a magus-to-be.
<br>
In the meantime, you are just the same as everyone else in this hall: peasants, laborers, merchants, one lining up behind another, each hoping to be granted permission to enter mainland Askava.
<br>
---
<ol>

(if: (datanames: $char's player's timerQuest) contains "permitAskava")[
	(if: $char's player's timerQuest's permitAskava's wait > 0)[<li>~~Line up and await your turn.~~ $cssDesc[ (Your entry application is being processed.)]]
	(else:)[<li>(link: "Line up to receive your Askava entry permit. ⧗")[(goto: "AskavaPermit 1b")]</li>]
]
(else:)[<li>(link: "Line up and await your turn. ⧗")[(goto: "AskavaPermit 1a")]</li>]

<li>(link: "Never mind.")[$funcBack]

</ol>
]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->